window.CUBE_COLLECTION = [{"id":"018","heading":"018 · 原第17题","source":"S031 · 上海外国语大学附属外国语学校松江云间中学 · 高二 · 2025-2026 · 期中 · 原第17题","skill":"正方体中借助平面交线证明点共线，并证明两条直线异面。","revisionHtml":"<p><strong>校订提示</strong></p>\n<p>题干“<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BP</annotation></semantics></math></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HG</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相交于点 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span>”中的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BP</annotation></semantics></math></span> 应为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF</annotation></semantics></math></span>：由解析 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>⊂</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q\\in EF\\subset</annotation></semantics></math></span> 平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABCD</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>⊂</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q\\in HG\\subset</annotation></semantics></math></span> 平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CDD_1C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> 可确认相交的是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF</annotation></semantics></math></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HG</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n<p>下列正文保留原转录；与本提示冲突的文字或公式不作为有效依据。</p>","stemHtml":"<p>如图，已知 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E, F, G, H</annotation></semantics></math></span> 分别是正方体 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABCD - A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的棱 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB, BC, CC_{1}, C_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的中点，且 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BP</annotation></semantics></math></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HG</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相交于点 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> .</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/b9eb35aeee3bd51a15273606.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>(1) 求证: 点 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DC</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上;</p>\n<p>(2) 求证: <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF</annotation></semantics></math></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是异面直线.</p>","answerHtml":"<p>(1) 证明见解析</p>\n<p>(2) 证明见解析</p>","analysisHtml":"<p>(1) 平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>∩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABCD \\cap</annotation></semantics></math></span> 平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CDD_{1}C_{1} = DC,</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>⊂</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q \\in EF \\subset</annotation></semantics></math></span> 平面ABCD, <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>⊂</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q \\in HG \\subset</annotation></semantics></math></span> 平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CDD_{1}C_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q \\in DC</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，也即点 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DC</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上.</p>\n<p>(2) 假设EF与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 不是异面直线.</p>\n<p>则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF</annotation></semantics></math></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是共面直线，又 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 外，</p>\n<p>则过E与直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 有唯一平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BAA_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，所以可得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>∈</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F\\in</annotation></semantics></math></span> 平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BAA_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<p>这与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BAA_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 外矛盾，故 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF</annotation></semantics></math></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是异面直线.</p>"},{"id":"020","heading":"020 · 原第20题","source":"S031 · 上海外国语大学附属外国语学校松江云间中学 · 高二 · 2025-2026 · 期中 · 原第20题","skill":"正方体截面的周长与面积；截面形状与参数范围；截面分割与体积比","revisionHtml":"","stemHtml":"<p>在棱长为1的正方体 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABCD-A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中，E是BC的中点，F,G分别是CD, <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上的动点.考查过E,F,G三点的平面截正方体所得的截面：</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/af329a49bcb5689c3cb0be5e.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/4e0119728b9c1fa7f5619035.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>(1) 当 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CD</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的中点且 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的中点时, 直接写出截面的周长和面积;</p>\n<p>(2) 当 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DF}{DC} = \\frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 时，若截面为六边形，求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DG}{DD_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的取值范围；</p>\n<p>(3) 当 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的中点且截面为五边形时, 是否存在点 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> , 使得截面将正方体分为体积比1:2的两个部分, 若存在, 求出 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DF}{DC}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的值; 若不存在, 说明理由.</p>","answerHtml":"<p>(1) 周长为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，面积为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ;</p>\n<p>(2) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DG}{DD_1} \\in \\left(\\frac{1}{5}, \\frac{1}{2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(3) 存在, <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DF}{DC} = 3\\sqrt{2} - 4</annotation></semantics></math></span> 或 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DF}{DC} = 5 - 3\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","analysisHtml":"<p>(1) 作图：取 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{1}B_{1}, A_{1}D_{1}, BB_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中点，连接这六个点即可得到截面，</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/eb106c705bb884a1b3ca3ffc.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>由图可知截面是边长为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的正六边形，</p>\n<p>∴周长为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，面积为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ;</p>\n<p>(2) 分别找出截面为六边形的两种临界情况，分别如下图所示: 情况①</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/7a729b2bcabc0b7e7814703e.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>∵E为BC中点，∴BM=CF= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> AB，即AM= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{5}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> AB,</p>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because \\frac {G N}{A _ {1} N} = \\frac {N F}{M N} = \\frac {D F}{A M} = \\frac {\\frac {1}{3} C D}{\\frac {5}{3} A B} = \\frac {1}{5},</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\therefore \\frac {D G}{D D _ {1}} = \\frac {G N}{A _ {1} N} = \\frac {1}{5},</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>情况②</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/e1173e4769264a4d2a8ccd66.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>∵E为BC中点，∴BM=CF= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> AB，即AM= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{5}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> AB,</p>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because \\frac {G N}{P N} = \\frac {N F}{M N} = \\frac {D F}{A M} = \\frac {\\frac {1}{3} C D}{\\frac {5}{3} A B} = \\frac {1}{5},</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because \\frac{BB_{1}}{PA} = \\frac{MB}{AM} = \\frac {2}{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 即 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PA = \\frac{5}{2} BB_{1} = \\frac{5}{2} DD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\therefore \\frac {D G}{D D _ {1}} = \\frac {D G}{\\frac {2}{5} A P} = \\frac {5}{2} \\frac {D G}{A P} = \\frac {5}{2} \\times \\frac {1}{5} = \\frac {1}{2},</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>故 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DG}{DD_1} \\in \\left( \\frac{1}{5}, \\frac{1}{2} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(3) (1) 如图, 截面与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{1}D_{1}, B_{1}C_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相较于点 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M, N</annotation></semantics></math></span> , 延长 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>G</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MG, AD</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相较于点 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> , 连接 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EQ</annotation></semantics></math></span> 交 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CD</annotation></semantics></math></span> 与点 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/67b5ebd222a62c7ea64aed92.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>设 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DF = \\lambda (\\lambda \\in (0,1))</annotation></semantics></math></span> ， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>∴</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because \\frac{DQ}{CE} = \\frac{DF}{CF} = \\frac{\\lambda}{1 - \\lambda},\\therefore DQ = \\frac{\\lambda}{2 - 2\\lambda},</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>∵G为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中点，∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MD_{1}=DQ=\\frac{\\lambda}{2-2\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<p>延长NE, GF, <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CC_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相交于点P，延长NM, FG, <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相交于点O,</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/d9cf205283023ca4cc572abe.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>∵G为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中点，∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OD_{1}=DF=\\lambda,</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>又 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>∴</mo><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because\\frac{OD_{1}}{OC_{1}}=\\frac{MD_{1}}{NC_{1}}=\\frac{\\lambda}{1+\\lambda}=\\frac{\\frac{\\lambda}{2-2\\lambda}}{NC_{1}},\\therefore NC_{1}=\\frac{1+\\lambda}{2-2\\lambda},</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>∴</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because \\frac {P C}{P C _ {1}} = \\frac {E C}{N C _ {1}} = \\frac {P C}{P C + 1} = \\frac {\\overline {{2}}}{1 + \\lambda}, \\therefore P C = \\frac {1 - \\lambda}{2 \\lambda},</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>正方体被截得的其中一个多面体体积为V,</p>\n<p>则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = V_{N - C_1OP} - V_{E - CFP} - V_{M - ODG},</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac {1}{3} = \\frac {1}{3} \\times \\frac {1 + \\lambda}{2 - 2 \\lambda} \\times \\frac {1}{2} \\times (1 + \\lambda) \\times \\frac {1 + \\lambda}{2 \\lambda} - \\frac {1}{3} \\times \\frac {1}{2} \\times \\frac {1}{2} \\times (1 - \\lambda) \\times \\frac {1 - \\lambda}{2 \\lambda} - \\frac {1}{3} \\times \\frac {\\lambda}{2 - 2 \\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 = \\frac {(1 + \\lambda) ^ {3}}{8 \\lambda - 8 \\lambda^ {2}} - \\frac {(1 - \\lambda) ^ {2}}{8 \\lambda} - \\frac {\\lambda^ {2}}{8 - 8 \\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>整理得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda^2 + 8\\lambda - 2 = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，解得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = \\pm 3\\sqrt{2} - 4</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>∴</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because \\lambda \\in (0,1), \\therefore \\lambda = 3\\sqrt{2} - 4,</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>即 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DF}{DC} = \\lambda = 3\\sqrt{2} - 4,</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(2) 如图:</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/f21ec671c4f84aaac6c94c0e.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>∵点E为BC中点，∴NB=CF,</p>\n<p>∵点G为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中点，∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DG=\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DF = \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span> （ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu \\in (0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ），则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NB = CF = 1 - \\mu, AN = 2 - \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>又∵ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DF}{AN}=\\frac{DM}{AM}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，即 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\mu}{2-\\mu}=\\frac{DM}{DM+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DM=\\frac{\\mu}{2-2\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AM=DM+1=\\frac{2-\\mu}{2-2\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because \\frac{GD}{AP} = \\frac{DM}{AM}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 即 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>∴</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{GD}{AP} = \\frac{\\mu}{2 - \\mu},\\therefore AP = \\frac{2 - \\mu}{2\\mu},</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because \\frac{BT}{AP} = \\frac{NB}{AN}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 即 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>∴</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{BT}{\\frac{2 - \\mu}{2\\mu}} = \\frac{1 - \\mu}{2 - \\mu},\\therefore BT = \\frac{1 - \\mu}{2\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>其中一个多面体体积为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = V_{P - AMN} - V_{T - BNE} - V_{G - DFM}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac {1}{3} = \\frac {1}{3} \\times \\frac {2 - \\mu}{2 \\mu} \\times \\frac {1}{2} \\times \\frac {2 - \\mu}{2 - 2 \\mu} \\times (2 - \\mu) - \\frac {1}{3} \\times \\frac {1 - \\mu}{2 \\mu} \\times \\frac {1}{2} \\times \\frac {1}{2} \\times (1 - \\mu) - \\frac {1}{3} \\times \\frac {1}{2} \\times \\frac {1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times \\mu \\times \\frac {\\mu}{2 - 2 \\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8 u - 8 u ^ {2} = (2 - \\mu) ^ {3} - (1 - \\mu) ^ {3} - \\mu^ {3}</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>化简得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu^3 - 11\\mu^2 + 17\\mu - 7 = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，即 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mu - 1)(\\mu^2 - 10\\mu + 7) = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∴</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\therefore \\mu = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span> 或 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = 5 \\pm 3\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> , <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\because \\mu \\in (0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∴</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\therefore \\mu = 5 - 3 \\sqrt {2},</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>即 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DF}{DC} = \\mu = 5 - 3\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>综上所述，这样的点存在， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DF}{DC} = 3\\sqrt{2} -4</annotation></semantics></math></span> 或 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{DF}{DC} = 5 - 3\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>"},{"id":"032","heading":"032 · 原第18题","source":"S054 · 上海市大同中学 · 高二 · 2025-2026 · 期中 · 原第18题","skill":"空间向量证线线垂直；空间向量求直线角；线段上定距离点","revisionHtml":"<p><strong>校订提示</strong></p>\n<p>第（3）问原 PDF 第13页写“棱 C′D”，该指定对象实际为侧面对角线，按线段 C′D 理解，不改成 C′D′；距离目标是平面 B′MN。以 C 为原点，平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E=(\\lambda,0,1-\\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\lambda\\le1</annotation></semantics></math></span>。由距离式得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=2/3</annotation></semantics></math></span>，故 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mtext>′</mtext><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C′E=2\\sqrt2/3</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n<p>下列正文保留原转录；与本提示冲突的文字或公式不作为有效依据。</p>","stemHtml":"<p>如图，已知正方体 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A B C D - A ^ { \\prime } B ^ { \\prime } C ^ { \\prime } D ^ { \\prime }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的棱长为1，点M、N分别是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B B ^ { \\prime }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">| C A ^ { \\prime }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的中点.</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/d30d2073f3013a1da0e3a14c.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>(1) 求证: <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊥</mi><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M N \\bot B B ^ { \\prime }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(2) 求直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B C ^ { \\prime }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M N</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所成角的大小;</p>\n<p>(3） 棱C&#39;D上是否存在一点E，使得E到平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C ^ { \\prime } D</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B ^ { \\prime } M N</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的距离为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">?</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{ \\frac { \\sqrt { 2 } } { 6 } } ?</annotation></semantics></math></span> 若存在，请求出线段 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C ^ { \\prime } .</annotation></semantics></math></span> E的长度，若不存在，请说明理由.</p>","answerHtml":"<p>(1) 证明见解析</p>\n<p>(2) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>60</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6 0 ^ { \\circ }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(3) 存在, <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C ^ { \\prime } E = \\frac { 2 \\sqrt { 2 } } { 3 }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","analysisHtml":"<p>(1) 如图所示，以C为坐标原点， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C D , C B , C C ^ { \\prime }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 分别为x,y,z轴建立空间直角坐标系，</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/ebb874bc219f26c06d78446a.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\left( 0 , 1 , 0 \\right) , C \\left( 0 , 0 , 0 \\right) , D \\left( 1 , 0 , 0 \\right) , A ^ { \\prime } \\left( 1 , 1 , 1 \\right) , B ^ { \\prime } \\left( 0 , 1 , 1 \\right) , C ^ { \\prime } \\left( 0 , 0 , 1 \\right) , D ^ { \\prime } \\left( 0 , 0 , 1 \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>因为点M、N分别是BB&#39;和CA&#39;的中点，则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M \\left( 0 , 1 , { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } \\right) , N \\left( { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } , { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } , { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>可得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { \\cdot M N } = \\left( \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , - \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , 0 \\right) , \\overrightarrow { B B ^ { \\prime } } = ( 0 , 0 , 1 )</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>因为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { M N } \\cdot \\overrightarrow { B B ^ { \\prime } } = \\frac { 1 } { 2 } - \\frac { 1 } { 2 } + 0 = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊥</mi><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M N \\bot B B ^ { \\prime }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(2)由（1）可知: <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { M N } = \\left( \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , - \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , 0 \\right) , \\overrightarrow { B C ^ { \\prime } } = ( 0 , - 1 , 1 )</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>设直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B C ^ { \\prime }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和MN所成角的大小θ，则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∘</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 ^ { \\circ } \\leq \\theta \\leq 6 0 ^ { \\circ }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>M·BC&#39; 1 则cos θ = COS MN, BC&#39; 二 二 2 12 M BC&#39; √2 ×√2 2</p>\n<p>可得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = 6 0 ^ { \\circ }</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，所以直线BC&#39;和MN所成角的大小为60°.</p>\n<p>(3）由（1）可知： <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { M N } = \\left( \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , - \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , 0 \\right) , \\overrightarrow { M B ^ { \\prime } } = \\left( 0 , 0 , \\frac { 1 } { 2 } \\right) , \\overrightarrow { B ^ { \\prime } C ^ { \\prime } } = ( 0 , - 1 , 1 ) , \\overrightarrow { C ^ { \\prime } D } = ( 1 , 0 , - 1 )</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>设平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B ^ { \\prime } M N</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的法向量为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec { \\mid n } = ( x , y , z )</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left\\{ \\begin{array} { l l } { { \\displaystyle { \\vec { n } } \\cdot { \\overrightarrow { M N } } = { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } x - { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } y = 0 } } \\\\ { { \\displaystyle { \\vec { n } } \\cdot { \\overrightarrow { M B ^ { \\prime } } } = { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } z = 0 } } \\end{array} \\right. \\nonumber</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = 1 , z = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，可得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"sans-serif\">Π</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"sans-serif\">F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec { \\mathsf { \\Pi } } _ { \\vec { \\mathsf { F } } } \\vec { n } = ( 1 , 1 , 0 )</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { C ^ { \\prime } E } = \\lambda \\overrightarrow { C ^ { \\prime } D } = \\left( \\lambda , 0 , - \\lambda \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\in [ 0 , 1 ]</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，可得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { B ^ { \\prime } E } = \\overrightarrow { B ^ { \\prime } C ^ { \\prime } } + \\overrightarrow { C ^ { \\prime } E } = \\lambda \\overrightarrow { C ^ { \\prime } D } = ( \\lambda , - 1 , - \\lambda )</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>因为点E到平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B ^ { \\prime } M N</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的距离为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{ \\frac { \\left| { \\overrightarrow { B ^ { \\prime } E } } \\cdot { \\overrightarrow { n } } \\right| } { \\left| { \\overrightarrow { n } } \\right| } } = { \\frac { \\left| \\lambda - 1 \\right| } { \\sqrt { 2 } } } = { \\frac { \\sqrt { 2 } } { 6 } }</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，解得 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = \\frac { 2 } { 3 }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 或 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = \\frac 4 3</annotation></semantics></math></span> (舍去),</p>\n<p>所以存在点E， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C ^ { \\prime } E = { \\frac { 2 } { 3 } } C ^ { \\prime } C = { \\frac { 2 { \\sqrt { 2 } } } { 3 } }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>"},{"id":"040","heading":"040 · 原第17题","source":"S018 · 上海市第五十四中学 · 高二 · 2025-2026 · 期中 · 原第17题","skill":"用平行线传递性证明四点共面；异面直线所成角的平移法","revisionHtml":"","stemHtml":"<p>在正方体 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABCD - A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> 为棱 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{1}C_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的中点， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 为棱 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{1}C_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的中点</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/909e0737f96891ca0ab1312d.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>(1) 求证: <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mtext>、</mtext><mi>F</mi><mtext>、</mtext><mi>B</mi><mtext>、</mtext><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E 、 F 、 B 、 D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 四点共面;</p>\n<p>(2) 求异面直线EF与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所成角的大小.</p>","answerHtml":"<p>(1) 证明见解析. (2) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\pi}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","analysisHtml":"<p>(1) 根据三角形中位线定理和平行线的传递性, 可证 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF \\parallel BD</annotation></semantics></math></span> , 即可推证结论;</p>\n<p>(2) 由直线间的平行关系, 可得异面直线EF与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所成角就是角 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\angle AD_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> .</p>\n<p>(1) 连接 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<p>∵ E 为棱 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{1}C_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的中点, F 为棱 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{1}C_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的中点, ∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF // B_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>∵正方体ABCD-A\\_{1}B\\_{1}C\\_{1}D\\_{1},∴BB\\_{1}=DD\\_{1},BB\\_{1}//DD\\_{1}</p>\n<p>∴四边形 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BB_{1}D_{1}D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是平行四边形,∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BD//B_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∴</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\therefore BD // EF, BD, EF</annotation></semantics></math></span> 确定一平面.</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∴</mo><mi>E</mi><mtext>、</mtext><mi>F</mi><mtext>、</mtext><mi>B</mi><mtext>、</mtext><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\therefore E 、 F 、 B 、 D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 四点共面；</p>\n<p>(2) 由 (1) 得: <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF \\parallel B_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\therefore \\angle AD_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 或补角为异面直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF</annotation></semantics></math></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所成角，</p>\n<p>在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta AD_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AD_{1} = D_{1}B_{1} = B_{1}A,\\therefore \\angle AD_{1}B_{1} = \\frac{\\pi}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>∴异面直线EF与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所成角为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\pi}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> .</p>\n<p>本题考查点共面,关键要对确定平面的条件要熟练掌握;考查空间角,空间角用几何法求,要体现作、证、算三步骤.</p>"},{"id":"049","heading":"049 · 原第17题","source":"S027 · 上海市长征中学 · 高二 · 2025-2026 · 期中 · 原第17题","skill":"正方体各面中心构成的正八面体体积计算。并分析相关参数与取值。","revisionHtml":"","stemHtml":"<p>如图所示，正方体的棱长为3，试计算以其所有面的中心为顶点的多面体的体积.</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/0b1e2fa111dc09049d629246.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">","answerHtml":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{9}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","analysisHtml":"<p>结合图形分析可得以正方体所有面的中心为顶点的多面体是由两个有公共底面的正四棱锥组合而成的八面体,根据棱锥的体积公式可求得其体积.</p>\n<p>由题意知，所给的几何体是八面体，它由两个有公共底面的正四棱锥组合而成.</p>\n<p>因为正方体的棱长为3，所以四棱锥的高为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/66071db33b3bc8c03e348996.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>因为正方体任意两个相邻的侧面中心间的距离等于其面对角线的一半，即 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，所以该正四棱锥底面面积为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\times\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\frac{9}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> .</p>\n<p>所以这个八面体的体积为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>正四棱锥</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2V_{正四棱锥}=2\\times\\frac{1}{3}\\times\\frac{9}{2}\\times\\frac{3}{2}=\\frac{9}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> .</p>"},{"id":"055","heading":"055 · 原第20题","source":"S038 · 上海海洋大学附属大团高级中学 · 高二 · 2025-2026 · 期中 · 原第20题","skill":"空间向量的基向量表示；直线与平面所成的角；异面直线所成角与参数","revisionHtml":"","stemHtml":"<p>如图， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ABCD - A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 为正方体，动点 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在对角线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BD_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上，记 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{|D_1P|}{|D_1B|} = \\lambda .</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/9917283b57249b92d4414d69.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>(1) 用向量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{AB}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 、 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{AD}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 、 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{AA_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 表示向量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{AC_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ;</p>\n<p>(2) 若 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = \\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> , 求直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AP</annotation></semantics></math></span> 与平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PBC</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所成角的大小;</p>\n<p>(3) 若异面直线AP与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所成角为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\pi}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的值.</p>","answerHtml":"<p>(1) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{AC_1} = \\overrightarrow{AB} +\\overrightarrow{AD} +\\overrightarrow{AA_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(2) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = \\arcsin \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(3) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","analysisHtml":"<p>(1) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{AC_1} = \\overrightarrow{AC} +\\overrightarrow{CC_1} = \\overrightarrow{AB} +\\overrightarrow{AD} +\\overrightarrow{AA_1};</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(2) 建立如图所示空间直角坐标系，设正方体边长为1,</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/9e9e535e7779798df2847f7f.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>则有 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,0,0),B(1,1,0),C(0,1,0),D_{1}(0,0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，又因为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{|D_1P|}{|D_1B|} = \\lambda ,</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{D_1B} = (1,1, - 1),\\overrightarrow{D_1P} = (\\lambda ,\\lambda , - \\lambda),</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{PA} = \\overrightarrow{PD_1} +\\overrightarrow{D_1A} = (-\\lambda_2, - \\lambda ,\\lambda) + (1,0, - 1) = (1 - \\lambda , - \\lambda ,\\lambda -1),</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = \\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{PA} = \\left(\\frac{1}{2}, - \\frac{1}{2}, - \\frac{1}{2}\\right),P\\left(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2}\\right),</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>设平面PBC的法向量为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{n}=(x,y,z)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow {P C} = \\left(- \\frac {1}{2}, \\frac {1}{2}, - \\frac {1}{2}\\right), \\overrightarrow {B C} = (- 1, 0, 0),</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{n}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{BC}&amp;=0\\\\\\overrightarrow{n}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{PC}&amp;=0\\end{aligned}\\right.</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>z</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x&amp;=0\\\\-\\frac{1}{2}x+\\frac{1}{2}y-\\frac{1}{2}z&amp;=0\\end{aligned}\\right.</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>令y=1，则z=1,x=0，所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{n}=(0,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<p>设直线AP与平面PBC所成角为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span> ,</p>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin \\theta = \\frac{\\left|\\overrightarrow{PA} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{n}\\right|}{\\left|\\overrightarrow{PA}\\right| \\cdot \\left|\\overrightarrow{n}\\right|} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2} \\times \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = \\arcsin \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ；</p>\n<p>(3) 因为异面直线AP与 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{1}B_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所成角为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\pi}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{PA}=(1-\\lambda,-\\lambda,\\lambda-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{1}(1,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{1}(0,0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{D_1B_1} = (1,1,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>×</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{4} = \\frac{\\left|\\overrightarrow{PA}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{D_1B_1}\\right|}{\\left|\\overrightarrow{PA}\\right|\\cdot\\left|\\overrightarrow{D_1B_1}\\right|} = \\frac{|1 - 2\\lambda|}{\\sqrt{2}\\times\\sqrt{2(1 - \\lambda)^2 + \\lambda^2}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda^2 = 1, \\lambda = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>"},{"id":"061","heading":"061 · 原第17题","source":"S043 · 复旦大学附属复兴中学 · 高二 · 2025-2026 · 期中 · 原第17题","skill":"正方体中计算异面直线所成角及二面角。并分析相关参数与取值。","revisionHtml":"","stemHtml":"<p>如图，在正方体 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A B C D - A _ { 1 } B _ { 1 } C _ { 1 } D _ { 1 }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中.</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/a5f9618d8db68344bb76e293.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>(1) 求异面直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A _ { 1 } C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和BD所成角的大小；</p>\n<p>(2) 求二面角 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B - A _ { 1 } C - D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的大小.</p>","answerHtml":"<p>(1) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac { \\pi } { 2 }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(2) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo><mover><mo><mn>2</mn></mo><mrow></mrow></mover></mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac { \\stackrel {  } { 2 } \\pi } { 3 }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","analysisHtml":"<p>(1)</p>\n<img src=\"https://cheng-bai.github.io/shanghai-math-essay-collection/assets/e844632bbfbf40cb51e639a3.jpg\" alt=\"题目图示\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p>不妨设正方体边长为1，以D为坐标原点， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { D A } , \\overrightarrow { D C } , \\overrightarrow { D D _ { 1 } }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 分别为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x , y ,</annotation></semantics></math></span> z轴正方向建立空间直角坐标系，则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A _ { 1 } \\left( 1 , 0 , 1 \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> , C (0, 1, 0), D (0, 0, 0), <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\left( 1 , 1 , 0 \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> .</p>\n<p>从而 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{ \\overrightarrow { | A _ { 1 } C } } = ( - 1 , 1 , - 1 ) , { \\overrightarrow { B D } } = ( - 1 , - 1 , 0 )</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\overrightarrow { A _ { 1 } C } \\cdot \\overrightarrow { B D } = 1 - 1 = 0 ,</annotation></semantics></math></span> 故 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊥</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { A _ { 1 } C } \\bot \\overrightarrow { B D } .</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所以异面直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A _ { 1 }</annotation></semantics></math></span> C和BD所成角的大小为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac { \\pi } { 2 }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>(2)由（1), <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { D A _ { 1 } } = ( 1 , 0 , 1 ) , ~ \\overrightarrow { D C } = ( 0 , 1 , 0 ) , ~ \\overrightarrow { C A _ { 1 } } = ( 1 , - 1 , 1 ) , ~ \\overrightarrow { C B } = ( 1 , 0 , 0 ) .</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>设平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D A _ { 1 }</annotation></semantics></math></span> C的一个法向 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo><mover><mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">E</mi><mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mi></mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">△</mo></mover></mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\stackrel { \\vartriangle } { \\mathbf { E } \\boldsymbol { \\vec { \\mathbf { u } } } } = ( x , y , z )</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left\\{ { \\begin{array} { l } { { \\vec { n } } \\cdot { \\vec { D A _ { 1 } } } = x + z = 0 } \\\\ { { \\vec { n } } \\cdot { \\vec { D C } } = y = 0 } \\end{array} } \\right. .</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{ \\boldsymbol { x } } = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，则z=−1，y=0，古 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow { \\chi _ { n } } = ( 1 , 0 , - 1 )</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>同理：平面 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B A _ { 1 } C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的一个法向量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec { m } = ( 0 , 1 , 1 )</annotation></semantics></math></span> 2 故<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos &lt; \\overrightarrow { m } , \\overrightarrow { n } &gt; = \\frac { \\overrightarrow { m } \\cdot \\overrightarrow { n } } { \\left| \\overrightarrow { m } \\right| \\left| \\overrightarrow { n } \\right| } = \\frac { - 1 } { \\sqrt { 2 } \\cdot \\sqrt { 2 } } = - \\frac { 1 } { 2 } .</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p>由 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal { F } \\overrightarrow { m } = ( 0 , 1 , 1 )</annotation></semantics></math></span> 朝向二面角 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B - A _ { 1 } C - D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的外部， <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo><mover><mo><mi>n</mi></mo><mrow></mrow></mover></mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\stackrel {  } { n } = ( 1 , 0 , - 1 )</annotation></semantics></math></span> 朝向二面角 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B - A _ { 1 } C - D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的内部，故二面角 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B - A _ { 1 } C - D</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的余弦值为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos &lt; \\vec { m } , \\vec { n } &gt; = - \\frac { 1 } { 2 }</annotation></semantics></math></span> 从而其大小为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac { 2 \\pi } { 3 }</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>"}];
